00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:48.820
w gets updated as w minus a learning rate times the derivative.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:53.060
The derivative is positive, and so you end up subtracting from w.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.260
So you end up taking a step to the left.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:06:01.460
And so gradient descent would make your algorithm slowly decrease the parameter if you had started

